  turnin 5212 "The Flesh Does Not Lie" @71.7,49.9

step Houses of the Holy
  zone map 1423
  tip Click the Supply Crates lying around Stratholme (mostly on the Live/Scarlet side) for Stratholme Holy Water. · Some crates have bugs (rats) in them instead, so open them away from other mobs. · You need 5. · ~6,600 XP.
  complete 5243 "Houses of the Holy"
  turnin 5243 "Houses of the Holy" @71.9,48.3

step The Archivist
  zone map 1423
  tip Archivist Galford is in the last corridor of the Scarlet Bastion (Live side), just before Balnazzar. · Kill him, then click the book on his desk to set the Archive on fire. · Do this one first: it's what makes Balnazzar drop his head for the next chain. · ~8,300 XP.
  complete 5251 "The Archivist"
  turnin 5251 "The Archivist" @71.6,50.1

