step The Active Agent
  zone map 1423
  tip The Scourge Data is a tiny box on the floor inside ONE of the three ziggurats on the Undead side of Stratholme (it can spawn in any of them). · Check the floor of each ziggurat as you clear it. · Turn in to Betina Bigglezink at Light's Hope. · ~6,600 XP.
  complete 5213 "The Active Agent"
  turnin 5213 "The Active Agent" @71.7,49.9

